flowchart TD
    A[Query + verified access context] --> B[Query planner]
    B --> C[Tenant / ACL / time filters]
    C --> D[Authorized candidate set]
    D --> E[Lexical / dense / multi-vector retrieval]
    E --> F[Hybrid fusion and reranking]
    F --> G[Bounded graph expansion]
    G --> H[Context compression under token budget]
    H --> I[Citations with version / page / offsets]
    I --> J[Grounded answer or abstention]
    K[Cache key: tenant + ACL + model + index + policy] -. controls .-> E
    L[Shadow index migration] -. quality gate .-> F
